      "id": "c1129e3a6ca84b81b315d"
    },
    {
      "text": "#### Reading from the Kafka Source\n```\nTo read from Kafka, do the following in Structured Streaming:\n// in Scala\n\n// Subscribe to 1 topic\nval ds1 = spark.readStream.format(\"kafka\")\n.option(\"kafka.bootstrap.servers\", \"host1:port1,host2:port2\")\n.option(\"subscribe\", \"topic1\")\n.load()\n\n// Subscribe to multiple topics\nval ds2 = spark.readStream.format(\"kafka\")\n.option(\"kafka.bootstrap.servers\", \"host1:port1,host2:port2\")\n.option(\"subscribe\", \"topic1,topic2\")\n.load()\n\n// Subscribe to a pattern of topics\nval ds3 = spark.readStream.format(\"kafka\")\n.option(\"kafka.bootstrap.servers\", \"host1:port1,host2:port2\")\n.option(\"subscribePattern\", \"topic.*\")\n.load()\n\n```",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "c4cb7b5b86914f82b0444"
    },
    {
      "text": "1. **The DStream API**:  DStreams API has several limitations\n- it is based purely on Java/Python objec and functions\n- api is purely based on processing time - to hanle event-time operation, applicaiton needs to implement their own customer hanleing\n- DStreams can only operate in a micro-batch fashion\n\n2. **Strutured streaming**: Structured Streaming is a higher-level streaming API built from the ground up on Spark’s\nStructured APIs. It is available in all the environments where structured processing runs,\nincluding Scala, Java, Python, R, and SQL\n\n- As of Apache Spark 2.2, the system only\nruns in a micro-batch model, but the Spark team at Databricks has announced an effort called\nContinuous Processing to add a continuous execution mode.\n- Structured Streaming ensures end-to-end, exactly-once\nprocessing as well as fault-tolerance through checkpointing and write-ahead logs.",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "ff53c2733ee143e0b2ccb"
    },
    {
