    {
      "text": "####Challenges of Stream Processing\n0. Processing out-of-order data based on application timestamps (also called event time)\n0. Maintaining large amounts of state\n0. Supporting high-data throughput\n0. Processing each event exactly once despite machine failures\n0. Handling load imbalance and stragglers\n0. Responding to events at low latency\n0. Joining with external data in other storage systems\n0. Determining how to update output sinks as new events arrive\n0. Writing data transactionally to output systems\n0. Updating your application’s business logic at runtime",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
